levels 30-33
zone The Barrens
keywords Summon Felhunter, Tome of the Cabal, Seeking Strahad, Strahad Farsan, Jorah Annison, Moldy Tome, Tattered Manuscript, Damaged Chest, Rod of Channeling, Reconstructed Tome, Dragonmaw Bonewarder, Dragonmaw Shadowwarder, Angerfang Encampment, The Binding, Box of Souls, Warlock, class pet
