why The felhunter, the demon to bring against spellcasters, and a Box of Souls for your shards.

# The felhunter for Horde warlocks: Seeking Strahad (2996 from Gan'rul
# Bloodeye, or 3001 from Carendin Halgar) to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet, Tome
# of the Cabal (1801 to Jorah Annison in the Undercity; 1803, the Moldy Tome
# on the Hillsbrad shore and the Tattered Manuscript in a Thousand Needles
# cave; 1805, three Rods of Channeling from the Wetlands Dragonmaw casters)
# and The Binding (1795) at Strahad's circle in Ratchet.
# Gan'rul's and Carendin's Seeking Strahad exclude each other; the guide sends
# Orcs and Trolls to Gan'rul and the Undead to Carendin.
# Drops: the rods from Dragonmaw Bonewarders (27) and Shadowwarders (28) at
# 80% (items.json); the raiders and other Dragonmaw drop none. The tome and
# the chest give their item every time. The Binding pays a Box of Souls.
# The fight: the Summoned Felhunter is level 30 and not elite; it appears only
# when the Tome of the Cabal is read at the circle, after Strahad and his
# acolytes finish drawing it. Lost fight: abandon The Binding and take it again
# from Strahad (quest notes, player reports).
# ASSUMED: The chain runs as in Classic above 30 (Classic flow; Forever's data has no play reports past the level-30 beta cap). In-game check: the cave chest, the murloc camp and Strahad's circle event.
# Sources: Forever's quest data (quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json,
# items.json) for the givers, the tome, the chest, the rods and the circle;
# the quest notes (data/local/mechanics) for the murloc camp, the cave path,
# the casters and the circle event; the reference class guides for the order.

step Seeking Strahad (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 30 Gan'rul Bloodeye, in the Cleft of Shadow under the Valley of Strength, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet.
  level 30
  accept 2996                         -- Gan'rul Bloodeye

step Seeking Strahad (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 30 Carendin Halgar, in the Magic Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar. Take only one Seeking Strahad: if Strahad offers nothing, drop the duplicate from your log.
  level 30
  accept 3001                         -- Carendin Halgar

step Strahad Farsan
  zone The Barrens
  tip Ratchet's flight point is a short flight from Orgrimmar's. Strahad Farsan stands on the hill above the town, behind the engineers' hut, by his little tower; Menara Voidrender and two acolytes are with him. He sends you to Jorah Annison in the Undercity.
  turnin 2996 only Orc,Troll          -- Strahad Farsan
  turnin 3001 only Undead             -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 1801

step Jorah Annison
  zone Undercity
  tip Jorah Annison is in the Magic Quarter of the Undercity. He wants two lost pieces of the Tome of the Cabal: one on the Hillsbrad coast, one in Thousand Needles.
  turnin 1801                         -- Jorah Annison
  accept 1803

step Moldy Tome
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip The tome is a small grey-blue book lying in the sand of a murloc camp on the shore south-west of Southshore, near the water's edge. Six or seven murlocs guard it and more lurk underwater: they come in groups, so Fear one and keep your voidwalker on the rest. Walk down to the water to click it; from the hillside the crates block the cursor.
  collect 6931 quest 1803.1           -- Moldy Tome, from the Tome of the Cabal on the sand

step Tattered Manuscript
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip The centaur cave opens in the cliffs north of Freewind Post. Inside, keep right at each fork, cross the pool by the small waterfall, and open the small dark box against the wall beside a larger chest: the larger one is the wrong one. You can open it only while on the quest. The centaurs respawn behind you on the way out.
  collect 6997 quest 1803.2           -- Tattered Manuscript, in the Damaged Chest

step Back to Jorah
  zone Undercity
  tip Jorah pieces the tome together and gives you the Reconstructed Tome: keep it, Strahad takes it with the rods.
  turnin 1803                         -- Jorah Annison
  accept 1805

step Rods of Channeling
  zone Wetlands
  tip The Dragonmaw hold Angerfang Encampment in the hills east of the road through the Wetlands, south of the Thandol Span you cross from Arathi Highlands. Only the casters drop the rods, four kills in five: the Bonewarders (level 27, with skeleton pets) and Shadowwarders (28). A steep path north of the central spirit healer leads up into the camp past most of the warriors.
  collect 6930 x3 quest 1805.1        -- Rods of Channeling, from the Dragonmaw casters

step The Binding
  zone The Barrens
  tip Back to Strahad in Ratchet. When you accept, he draws the summoning circle and his acolytes channel a greater circle over it: wait inside the tower until both are done. Then use the Tome of the Cabal on the circle. The felhunter (level 30, not elite) silences and eats mana, and it vanishes after two minutes: have your voidwalker out, open with your damage over time at once and let the voidwalker tank. If you die or it wins, abandon The Binding and take it again from Strahad. Keep the tome: Strahad takes it back.
  turnin 1805                         -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 1795
  use 6999 @62.6,35.3                 -- Tome of the Cabal, on the circle
  kill 6268 quest 1795.1              -- Summoned Felhunter
  turnin 1795                         -- Strahad Farsan: Summon Felhunter
